        75: "",
        76: "## Troubleshooting",
        77: "",
        78: "| status `error` | cause |",
        79: "| --- | --- |",
        80: "| `no such file or directory: ...` | the configured path does not exist |",
        81: "| `directory has no index.ts, index.mjs, index.js or package.json main: ...` | the directory has no entry module |",
        82: "| `the module must export a name matching ...` | missing or invalid `name` |",
        83: "| `the module's version must be a string of 1 to 40 characters without spaces` | invalid `version` |",
        84: "| `import timed out after ... ms`, `register timed out after ... ms` | slow top-level code or `register`; move slow work out of `register` |",
        85: '| `capability "<key>" was provided twice` | two `provide` calls with the same key |',
        86: "| `<capability>.<method> must be a function` | a provider is missing a required method |",
        87: "| `rpc.<method> must be a function with a kebab-case name` | an RPC method name with capitals or underscores |",
        88: "| `rpcPolicy.<method> must name an rpc method and be ...` | a policy for a method that does not exist, or an unknown kind |",
        89: '| `a plugin named "<name>" is already loaded`, `... is already provided by another plugin` | two plugins with one name, or one provider id or checkout kind |',
        90: '| `plugins.json is unreadable: ...` | the file is not `{ "plugins": ["/path", ...] }` |',
        91: "",
        92: "Panel errors show in the plugin's card in Settings → Plugins:",
        93: "",
        94: "| panel error | cause |",
        95: "| --- | --- |",
        96: "| `ui.js did not register a panel ...` | the script never called `window.piProjects.register` while it first ran |",
        97: '| `ui.js registered as "<other>"; ...` | `name` is not the plugin\'s own name |',
        98: "| `ui.js uses the retired context-panel hooks ...` | a card written for the classic inbox; port it to `mount(slot, panel)` |",
        99: "| `piProjects.register must be called while its ui.js runs` | `register` was called later, for example after an `await` |",
        100: "| `ui.js could not be loaded from ...` | the host could not read the file at its start (it answers 404) |",
        101: "| `ui.css could not be loaded from ...` | the same for the stylesheet; the panel still mounts |",
        102: "| any other message | what your script, `mount` or `action` threw |",
